# Use disposable simulator storage for this original first-puzzle route.
wait-for-id more
tap-id cell-0
tap-id pencil
tap-id digit-2
wait-idle
expect Row 1
shot sudoku-notes
tap-id undo
tap-id pencil
tap-id more
tap-id view
tap-id how-to-play
expect Use 1–9 once
shot sudoku-help
tap Back
wait-idle
shot sudoku-game
